  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d966c54451c3c66180b0f0bba2c151e, type: 3}
  m_Name: ResearchNotebook
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SubjectZero.Story.TextDocumentData
  documentTitle: Research Notebook
  bodyText: "[Aug 15, 2005]\nReassigned to the Subject Zero team today. Anselm says
    it's a \"career opportunity.\" I think it means nobody else wanted it. Okafor
    gave me a look in the hallway after the announcement \u2014 didn't say anything,
    just a look. I should've asked her what it meant.\n\n[Aug 29, 2005]\nFirst week
    on the loop team proper. The conditioning loop adjusts in real time \u2014 reads
    heart rate, cortisol proxies, even pupil dilation, and recalibrates the stimulus
    mid-session. It's not testing fear anymore. It's sculpting it. I said as much
    in the review. Nobody wrote it down. Anselm's response, paraphrased: \"That's
    the point.\" He didn't seem to think that needed further explanation.\n\n[Sept
    9, 2005]\nAsked to review six weeks of session logs today. The subject's baseline
    recovery time between cycles has been getting shorter. Should be the opposite
    \u2014 repeated exposure is supposed to build some tolerance, even in an adaptive
    model. It's not building tolerance. It's building technique.\n\n[Sept 20, 2005]\nIt
    watched me today. Not the cameras \u2014 it. Through the observation glass. I
    don't think it was supposed to know we were there. Anselm didn't seem surprised
    when I told him. That's the part I can't stop thinking about \u2014 he didn't
    seem surprised.\n\n[Sept 27, 2005]\nRequested a meeting outside the program to
    raise the review findings. Denied \u2014 \"not yet, not until we have more consistent
    data.\" I don't think there's a version of \"more consistent\" that ends this.
    I think the data is the excuse to keep going, not a reason to stop.\n\n[Oct 2,
    2005]\nI want out of this project. I've asked twice. Anselm keeps saying \"just
    one more cycle.\" I'm going to talk to someone outside the program. If you find
    this before I get the chance \u2014\n\n[End of entry]\n"
